    "slug": "hello-the-boring-edit",
    "title": "Hello, The Boring Edit",
    "subtitle": "A page where I document my articles, journey, roadmaps, resources, philosophy — and the interesting things I think, learn and find day to day.",
    "date": "2026-09-28",
